[{"title":"杂感三首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"汉武昔好道，燕齐方士来。\n纵横献迂怪，信之无嫌猜。\n遥临太一坛，高起通天台。\n金枝殿上陈，芙蓉掌中开。\n竹宫遥望拜，炯炯神光回。\n流连王母宴，诡谲方朔谐。\n昆仑九万里，瑶池安在哉。\n幻妄竟何成，荒淫诚可哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂感三首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"吾闻青海外，赤水西流沙。\n神人生鸟翼，蓬首乱如麻。\n出入乘两龙，左右臂双蛇。\n中有不死药，奇丽更纷葩。\n琅玕坠珠英，玗琪散瑶华。\n双双相合并，文文自交加。\n我愿从之游，万里迹非赊。\n但恐非人类，寿命其奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂感三首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"帝尧让天下，许由去洗耳。\n仲父牵牛过，不饮下流水。\n荣华若尘垢，富贵等泥滓。\n王阳始弹冠，贡公胡为喜。\n古今不相及，何啻千万里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禁城雪霁望西山","author":"蒋山卿","text":"积雪带回岭，素华丽高阙。\n玉掌对嵯峨，珠栊共鲜洁。\n振风向林杪，哀鸟下城堞。\n徘徊英英云，掩映纤纤月。\n幽赏虑自澄，旷望情弥惬。\n虽异梁园游，行吟良未辍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田园即事五首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"沉沉夜来雨，泱泱川上平。\n田家趋时作，驱牛急晨耕。\n遥遥阡陌间，肃肃老少并。\n札札耒与耜，咿咿桔槔声。\n纡回野水入，绵延禾稼盈。\n劬苦事一时，倏忽见秋成。\n四体虽云疲，所贵惟此生。\n此生各有分，胡乃不自营。\n寥寥千载下，宁知沮溺情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田园即事五首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"斜阳倏西下，片月已东出。\n鸡犬各还家，柴荆晚饭毕。\n邻舍语依然，儿女相牵率。\n鸣蛙水上喧，流萤花外疾。\n夜色向沉沉，旷望弥萧瑟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田园即事五首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"种瓜东门外，种豆南山下。\n遗荣等粪土，屏迹在田野。\n自昔有达士，而我非作者。\n偃息任疏顽，得性非虚假。\n不觉岁月迁，青春复徂夏。\n是时农务忙，尽日宾明寡。\n新竹带可围，青荷手堪把。\n于焉以永日，冲襟一潇洒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田园即事五首 其四","author":"蒋山卿","text":"立身本疏慢，罢官实所宜。\n追思十年往，犹是归来迟。\n聊租二顷田，以为三径资。\n故人有裘羊，旦夕与娱嬉。\n即看花满园，但要酒盈卮。\n高歌任性情，放言罕文辞。\n邈与世相绝，俯仰复何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田园即事五首 其五","author":"蒋山卿","text":"东菑耘事毕，老翁自闲闲。\n鼓腹何所知，徘徊墟落间。\n斜日上高原，一望江南山。\n搴林玩柔荑，涉涧弄潺湲。\n欣然适其适，日黑始来还。\n了无一可说，呼儿掩柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园秋日杂与四首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"曲径入林丘，柴门野水流。\n松间还倚杖，石上复垂钩。\n借问家中妇，今朝有酒不？\n前山夕阳下，吾意正悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园秋日杂与四首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"板桥横浦直，篱舍傍堤斜。\n年熟村多酿，秋深菊始华。\n溪鱼寒聚藻，田蟹夜行沙。\n野趣浑无厌，吾生即有涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园秋日杂与四首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"久作山林客，虚为野老知。\n鹤衣行曳屦，乌帽坐弹棋。\n煮茗频烧竹，炊羹旋刈葵。\n来朝菊花节，相约过东篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园秋日杂与四首 其四","author":"蒋山卿","text":"清夜耿不寐，端居兴杳然。\n蛩吟入床下，叶落堕阶前。\n麦陇耕残月，茅檐炊晓烟。\n只缘高卧稳，自觉懒情偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜佴参戎见过","author":"蒋山卿","text":"苍梧春欲暮，旅况复何如。\n上客烦骠骑，中厨具鲤鱼。\n流云城树暗，过雨径花疏。\n相过休言数，高谈赖起余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花残","author":"蒋山卿","text":"寂寂门空闭，菲菲花欲残。\n赏心不相见，对酒若为欢。\n小径芳烟霭，疏帘细雨寒。\n一年春又谢，惆怅思无端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8841,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓雨","author":"蒋山卿","text":"卧听春园雨，虚帏寒气侵。\n闲愁亦底事，只觉扰余心。\n杨柳交黄鸟，池塘遍绿阴。\n兴来思蚤起，回步一相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8842,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴水部客中除夕为赋此诗","author":"蒋山卿","text":"客思乡心此夕并，萧条官舍若为情。\n筵前柏叶金杯浅，院里梅花粉署清。\n门掩疏灯人语寂，山留残雪夜寒生。\n起来遥祝君王寿，却忆鹓鸾一字行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8843,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田居即事四首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"草堂聊藉竹为门，花坞从将槿作垣。\n长日鸟啼红药尽，夕阳人坐绿阴繁。\n愁多非为逢时歉，住久应知隔世喧。\n赖有青山如旧故，年年相对两忘言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8844,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田居即事四首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"偶携藜杖过桥东，曲港潮流处处通。\n溪上闲花多覆水，村前垂柳半含风。\n黄昏鸟宿轻烟外，青野人耕细雨中。\n莫怪移家来畎亩，欲将遗事学庞公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8845,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田居即事四首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"水榭风亭取次开，新凉应有客同杯。\n树阴深处黄鹂语，溪水平时白鸟来。\n葵扇偶从邻妪买，荷衣旋学野人裁。\n花间蝴蝶双飞去，正是山翁午梦回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田居即事四首 其四","author":"蒋山卿","text":"两过苔荒石径微，林园一向掩柴扉。\n柳堤潮满鱼苗上，麦陇风晴雉子飞。\n花暝更教移晚酌，竹深犹遣著寒衣。\n老人本自心无事，不为投闲始息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊申正月初宿休园","author":"蒋山卿","text":"江村物候又惊新，月色花香并换春。\n自笑无能惟野性，熟知有味是闲身。\n茅檐迟日遍宜懒，竹院风清不受尘。\n终日闭门常谢客，只应酒伴得相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别孙刑部还京次衡山韵","author":"蒋山卿","text":"早因休沐出承明，又见弹冠上帝京。\n芳草五湖初放棹，华林三月细啼莺。\n浮云莫叹当时事，零雨还传旧日名。\n二十年前题汉柱，为君飞动不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉送白岩相公扈跸凯旋三十韵","author":"蒋山卿","text":"帝室何多故，亲藩自取亡。\n从教赐几杖，讵意缺锜斨。\n氛祲霾彭蠡，妖星孛豫章。\n官寮甘就戮，郡县泣罹殃。\n百姓为鱼肉，宗人化犬羊。\n漫看传羽檄，妄欲改冠裳。\n司马当分阃，留都况接疆。\n算筹期克胜，师旅素张皇。\n掎角遥成势，风声孰敢当。\n焚舟才走敌，扫穴已擒王。\n北阙纡忧切，南征独断刚。\n六军行自将，千乘拥前行。\n事异荧离斗，时维律应商。\n投戈回落日，出号肃秋霜。\n露布收江右，行宫入建康。\n威仪喜重见，礼数觉周防。\n奠庙金扉启，朝正玉佩锵。\n辕门簪履集，陵寝旆旌扬。\n山在瞻龙虎，台荒识凤凰。\n烟花春烂熳，雾树晚苍茫。\n法驾还京早，楼船跨海长。\n承恩仍扈跸，激赏更登床。\n凯奏清飙急，笳吟白露凉。\n风云随浩荡，日月共翱翔。\n刘向论思畅，扬雄赋颂光。\n经纶才必异，畋猎兆非常。\n世想更弦辙，朝思引栋梁。\n中兴宜陋汉，旧俗好归唐。\n幕府空留滞，词场屡激昂。\n骞腾瞻事业，徙倚卜行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林以乘赴任江西佥宪","author":"蒋山卿","text":"先帝昔巡幸，小臣同上书。\n事危攀折槛，情切止乘舆。\n未得陈丹悃，空令伏玉除。\n天心那可问，皇怒竟何如。\n氛雾昏霾久，雷霆震击余。\n伤魂逮囹圄，鞭血溅衣裾。\n半刺犹怜尔，孤游孰起予。\n联翩嗟去国，萧索苦虽居。\n圣哲临宸极，清明开太虚。\n王纲重照洗，奸孽尽诛锄。\n紫诏恩初降，苍生愤始摅。\n逐臣皆见召，旧故复相于。\n禁闼还通籍，官曹并直庐。\n感时唯涕泪，叹逝重欷歔。\n从宦心俱懒，求名术本疏。\n只应旅进退，敢望独吹嘘。\n翻怪无鸣鹤，堪怜似戏狙。\n十年才易组，六月便驱车。\n去作长途别，行将大暑袪。\n凉云停碧树，渌水泛红渠。\n南国秋风早，西江白露初。\n霜威迎獬豸，月令改蟾蜍。\n世路多欹侧，斯文有卷舒。\n身须混泾渭，誉欲等璠玙。\n霄汉看鹰隼，江湖觅鲤鱼。\n与君生死分，分手一踌蹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北狩凯旋歌三首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"帐下亲军尽虎貔，辫垂结束学胡儿。\n衔枚夜斫阴山寨，杀向平明虏不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北狩凯旋歌三首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"羽盖夸胡兽猎行，龙旂出塞犬羊平。\n宣府开为射熊馆，洋河筑作受降城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北狩凯旋歌三首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"紫云雪后绕关山，圣主巡游尚未还。\n风起满城闻凤吹，日高平地识龙颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行","author":"蒋山卿","text":"雪岭愁云冻不飞，黄沙白草路人稀。\n边城春色惟看柳，看到青时春已归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其一","author":"蒋山卿","text":"君王亲著紫霞裳，白玉冠簪八宝光。\n夜半碧坛星月冷，九天仙乐下鸾皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其二","author":"蒋山卿","text":"离宫复道接蓬莱，云绕千峰五色开。\n香辇无尘球箔卷，后宫遥从上陵回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其三","author":"蒋山卿","text":"令节繁华燕赏新，太平天子重词臣。\n诗成总是宫娥品，席上惊看夺锦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其四","author":"蒋山卿","text":"小年选入蕊珠宫，紫阁玲珑十二重。\n日侍上真修法事，水晶盘捧玉芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其五","author":"蒋山卿","text":"风卷珠帘月上钩，箧中纨扇不宜秋。\n炎凉只在君王手，莫拟承恩到白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其六","author":"蒋山卿","text":"碧殿瑶坛礼上清，桂华凉露浸银屏。\n双双玉女扶青案，跪启琅函讽道经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其七","author":"蒋山卿","text":"一夜梅开上苑东，淡烟斜月影朦胧。\n春魂愿逐香魂去，飞入君王晓梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词八首 其八","author":"蒋山卿","text":"香添沉水爇金炉，翠幕斜张绣被铺。\n却略挑灯试装束，夜深前殿有传呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵览旧","author":"蒋山卿","text":"小饮东山忆谢公，傲然携妓醉春风。\n即今桃李花间月，照入游人尊酒中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘氏水南亭子","author":"蒋山卿","text":"洛水桥南学士家，青林遥对碧山斜。\n春风细雨柴门闭，一树莺啼杏子花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋五日柬刘子","author":"蒋山卿","text":"郡斋五日思依依，客里清尊兴自违。\n微雨隔帘人不见，满庭蕉叶落花稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟","author":"蒋山卿","text":"柳边深系木兰桡，锦石青莎映画桥。\n夜半夜河光破碎，浪喧风起欲生潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"林大辂","text":"拥被息尘想，潇潇雨到蓬。\n孤城连禁柝，永夜动悲风。\n往事疏灯里，新愁浊酒中。\n南归稀信使，明发报征鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮踪","author":"林大辂","text":"浮踪甘屏裔，簿领亦闲闲。\n虎迹村间路，猿声郭外山。\n四愁仍欲结，双鬓渐成斑。\n长见乘槎者，天风万里还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中怀郑成昭","author":"林大辂","text":"径竹色逾净，窗蕉声转寒。\n流年频闭户，世事偶凭阑。\n绕郭见秋水，喧江闻暮滩。\n石村云卧者，迟尔话悲欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春直省","author":"林大辂","text":"旅梦醒啼鸟，晴窗日欲斜。\n还将多病眼，闲看续开花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙道中","author":"林大辂","text":"红紫山中野草花，三湘愁鬓倍年华。\n放臣消息春来好，月白千峰梦到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱四首 其一","author":"赵鹤","text":"分明苍秀拔云开，谁凿当年混沌胎。\n山压星辰从下看，海浮天地自东回。\n一时岱狩雍容礼，千古嵩高制作材。\n载说皇朝称祀诏，始知神哲奠三才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱四首 其二","author":"赵鹤","text":"一上遥岑万丈苍，天风应为袭衣裳。\n鸡鸣往往看东日，人语时时到下方。\n云暗钟声连海树，春浮花气入山堂。\n四时未歇登游兴，翻说崖禽唤客忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱四首 其三","author":"赵鹤","text":"转转官旌度几峰，不知花外有鸣钟。\n春空一望青苍里，晓殿齐开紫翠重。\n山鸟归时知雨意，崖松到处换云容。\n平生奇赏输今日，便欲淋浇浩荡胸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岱四首 其四","author":"赵鹤","text":"东皇祠下走灵氛，今古祈灵剩有文。\n不断香灯千里至，有时钟磬四山闻。\n雨声直过僧家竹，鸿影平低客路云。\n却爱三人花底饮，不妨对影到斜曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登州蓬莱阁观东海","author":"赵鹤","text":"蓬莱阁下晚凉开，倦客乘凉坐未回。\n不住鸟声冲雨过，有时龙起带潮来。\n愁云尚识田横岛，仙月还虚汉武台。\n回首夕阳瀛海上，一尊怀古独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"噪鹊行","author":"景旸","text":"鹊鹊复鹊鹊，春明飞向深树落。\n树边人家怀抱恶，去年征夫从卫霍。\n边头烽火接回中，羽书昼警清夜同。\n一自将军度河曲，天山万里风云空。\n边头战血赤河水，战士磨刀寒落指。\n天子深坐甘泉宫，回头北顾常拊髀。\n树头鹊噪如有知，朝来蟢子檐前垂。\n夫君封侯应有期，凤奁鸾镜当窗移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同友人泛湖","author":"王磐","text":"细柳新蒲绿未齐，楼船春泛五湖西。\n帆樯影里鱼争跃，箫鼓声中鸟杂归。\n宿雨暗添山色重，晴云轻度水容低。\n人家只在风烟外，面面天开罨画溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宵漫兴","author":"王磐","text":"天风吹散赤城霞，散落人间作九华。\n夹路星球留去马，烧空火树乱归鸦。\n笙歌醉月家家酒，帘幕窥春处处花。\n一派云《韶》天外迥，不知仙驭过谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中同古淮作","author":"王磐","text":"东风小阁陡生凉，尽日浓薰柏子香。\n好雨逡巡留客住，浮云南北为谁忙。\n青春未老看花眼，白首犹抄种菊方。\n湖上草生堤柳活，酒魂诗梦两茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈光哲","author":"王磐","text":"煮雪炉边夜坐痴，踏青驴上晓行迟。\n不知多少相思味，换得春来两鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香奁诗三首 其一","author":"张綖","text":"翡翠笼深烛影昏，当时一见已销魂。\n歌残玉宇云千叶，醉损珠帘月一痕。\n欲说竟成闲撚袖，偷看多是半衔樽。\n而今惜蕊怜花意，只有垂杨半倚门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香奁诗三首 其二","author":"张綖","text":"行遍回廊小立时，轻风吹动隔墙枝。\n年光荏苒偏伤客，往事参差欲怨谁。\n绣被香温催解佩，绮窗月淡称弹棋。\n酿成一种风流病，对月看花总泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香奁诗三首 其三","author":"张綖","text":"飞絮游丝舞作团，小楼春事又阑珊。\n锦鳞青羽书难觅，宝唾珠啼迹未干。\n蛱蝶芳魂花里瘦，蟾蜍清影月边寒。\n嗟予苦乏如皋技，莫怪蛾眉一笑难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏行","author":"张綖","text":"纨扇轻裾到处宜，暖风摇曳细腰肢。\n相逢绮陌回眸处，瞥见雕栏转角时。\n零乱佩环来冉冉，飘摇罗带去迟迟。\n东昏未识凌波趣，枉着金莲步步随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏芭蕉","author":"张綖","text":"长叶翩翻绿玉丛，植来况是近梧桐。\n美人闲立秋风里，羁客孤眠夜雨中。\n情逐舞鸾偏易感，事随梦鹿渺难穷。\n太湖石畔新凉院，何处吹箫月满空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其一","author":"史忠","text":"万树深林冻欲僵，高人吟雪坐寒窗。\n渔翁蓑笠归来晚，欲买前村新酒缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其二","author":"史忠","text":"二月江南花正开，山光欲翠水浮苔。\n绿阴到处还堪赏，不厌扁舟日日来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗四首 其三","author":"史忠","text":"雨晴江馆洞云归，桑落人家半掩扉。\n好是痴翁真不俗，挥毫便作米元晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]